            <description><![CDATA[<h2>In-app updates</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Helm checks for new GitHub releases once an hour while it is open.</li>
  <li>Choose Helm → Check for Updates… to check immediately.</li>
  <li>Helm verifies the update, downloads it, and installs and relaunches when you accept it.</li>
</ul>
<p>Install this version manually once to enable future in-app updates. Save terminal work before relaunching.</p>
]]></description>
